            <span>JavaScript</span>

            <span>HTML / CSS</span>

            <span>JSON-driven systems</span>

            <span>PWA</span>

            <span>Automated testing</span>

            <span>Accessibility</span>

            <span>Performance</span>

            <span>Process automation</span>

