      <section class="section-pad value-section">

        <div class="shell value-grid">

          <div>

            <p class="section-kicker">05 / What I Bring</p>

            <h2 class="section-title">The perspective of someone who has worked across the entire operating chain.</h2>

          </div>

          <div class="value-list">

            <div>

              <span>01</span>

              <p><strong>Commercial judgement</strong> grounded in purchasing, pricing, supplier and channel realities.</p>

            </div>

            <div>

              <span>02</span>

              <p><strong>Operational depth</strong> across inventory, warehousing, order flow, shipping and fulfillment.</p>

            </div>

            <div>

